msikey (1.0.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix swapped high/medium intensity codes (code 1 is full colour, code 0
    is the dim/hue-shifted one - was backwards). Fix effects.py to look up
    the byte via INTENSITY_CODES instead of INTENSITIES.index(), which
    would have gone out of sync with this fix.
  * Add systemd-sleep hook to restore the backlight after
    suspend/resume.

